{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36300","headline":"途中言事寄居远上人 · 方干","name":"途中言事寄居远上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"举目时时似故园，乡心自动向谁言。\n白云晓湿寒山寺，红叶夜飞明月村。\n震泽风帆归橘岸，钱塘水府抵城根。\n羡师了达无牵束，竹径生苔掩竹门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}